  "about": "I’m a software engineer at Dick’s Sporting Goods with 7+ years of experience building production systems and user-focused products.\n\nOutside of my day job, I’m the founder of Chronos (usechronos.io) — a tool I’m building to simplify and automate job applications.\n\nAfter seeing how repetitive, fragmented, and time-consuming job applications have become, I started working on a better way: one profile, less busywork, and fewer hours lost to the same questions over and over again.\n\nChronos is still early, and right now I’m focused on learning from real job seekers and building something genuinely useful — not selling hype.\n\nIf you’ve ever been frustrated by modern job applications, I’d love to hear what’s been most annoying or broken for you.",
